// chriz-iwd-encounters 310: one of Yxunomei's champions leaves the torture chamber
// for her side once she has appeared (on top of AR4005's script): it moves into her
// guards' team, turns hostile and jumps next to her with the Dimension Door visual.
// Not when it is dead or under the party's charm, nor when she is already dead.
// CIE_YXU_CHAMPION_<n> (area): 1 it has gone to her.

IF
  %cie_yxu_appeared%
  !Dead("Yxunomei")
  Global("CIE_YXU_CHAMPION_%cie_n%","MYAREA",0)
  HPGT("%cie_champion%",0)
  !StateCheck("%cie_champion%",STATE_CHARMED)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_YXU_CHAMPION_%cie_n%","MYAREA",1)%cie_team_line%
    ActionOverride("%cie_champion%",Enemy())
    ActionOverride("%cie_champion%",JumpToPoint([%cie_point%]))
    ActionOverride("%cie_champion%",CreateVisualEffectObject("DDOORH",Myself))
    Continue()
END
